      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Champions Cup",
          "heading": "Pau club's Théo Attissogbe inspires 41-17 Champions Cup win over Leicester",
          "body": "Club side Pau's 41-17 win over Leicester Tigers at Stade du Hameau in the Investec Champions Cup was a statement, with France star Théo Attissogbe central to it. The hosts trailed 10-3 after 18 minutes, led 17-10 at half-time and then scored 24 points to Leicester's seven after the break. Axel Desperes added 16 points off the boot, and the five-two try count earned Pau a bonus point."
        },
