      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury concern",
          "heading": "Jack Conan's shoulder injury needs further assessment before Farrell names Ireland squad",
          "body": "Leinster say Jack Conan's shoulder injury, which forced him off in the win over Clermont Auvergne, still needs further assessment, and the timing is awkward for Andy Farrell. Caelan Doris is expected to miss the November window after a knee infection delayed his recovery from surgery, so a prolonged Conan absence would leave Ireland without both first-choice number 8s. Leo Cullen initially said Conan would be out for a little while, with the full extent due within a week. Farrell names his squad on Wednesday."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
