          "heading": "Italy have lost four straight, most recently 57-10 to Australia in July",
          "body": "Italy enter their next match on four straight defeats. In their last five games, they have won one and lost four. The sequence, most recent first, is L L L L W. Their most recent game was a 57-10 away defeat to Australia in July, in the Nations Championship Group Stage. Next up is South Africa, the reigning world champions."
