        {
          "kicker": "Club return",
          "heading": "Club: Ex-Scotland captain Jamie Ritchie set for Glasgow Warriors debut against Benetton",
          "body": "In club news, Glasgow assistant coach Nigel Carolan says the time has come to unleash Jamie Ritchie, the 63-cap former Scotland captain, for his Warriors debut in Saturday's URC match against Benetton in Treviso. Back in full training after ankle and Achilles problems and summer surgery, Ritchie is expected to play this weekend, and Carolan frames the timing as useful before Scotland's Nations Cup, a couple of weeks away. He signed from Perpignan in the summer after 11 years at Edinburgh."
        },
