      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Coaching hire",
          "heading": "Ben Whitehouse joins Steve Tandy's Wales staff as full-time specialist coach",
          "body": "Steve Tandy has borrowed a page from Rassie Erasmus's playbook. The WRU announced on Monday that Ben Whitehouse has joined the men's national squad full-time as a specialist coach, working with coaches and players on law, discipline, decision-making and communication. The 36-year-old is set to hang up his whistle after Saturday's URC clash between the Ospreys and Dragons in Swansea, and the model echoes South Africa's appointment of Jaco Peyper as laws adviser in 2024."
        },
