      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "TMO review",
          "heading": "Argentina's England defeat stays at heart of TMO row before November",
          "body": "England's win over Argentina remains the reference point for a TMO row that is still open. Dave Rennie is set to raise the controversy at World Rugby's November officials meeting, and the BBC's match headline called the game 'Chaos' and 'comedy refereering'. A separate Springboks-Wallabies iPhone TMO saga is being framed as a major red flag ahead of the 2027 World Cup. Nothing in the reporting so far says what the November meeting will change, so Argentina's stake stays unresolved until World Rugby publishes new guidance."
        },
        {
